  ADD COLUMN tolerance_pct DOUBLE COMMENT 'the stated organisational tolerance for violating rows on this element, as a percentage of rows in scope. A CEILING on fail_threshold_pct for any rule attached to a binding of this element -- a rule may be stricter, never looser. NULL means no tolerance has been declared.';

